Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Novak, welcome back to Cincinnati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,诺瓦克 欢迎回到辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What were the key factors in your decision
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么让你决定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,回来打？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I honestly wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to have uh at least uh you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,one tournament coming into US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在美网之前打一站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Um haven't played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从温网之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,since uh since Wimbledon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,就没打过比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and my body reacted quite well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,而温网之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,after Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的身体反应相当好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It was the best that my body felt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 那是过去两年里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,after any Grand Slam in the last two years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,任何一个大满贯之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我身体最好的一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,any other grand slam I played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,过去两年我打的每一个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in the last two years there was some kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,之后都会有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,of injury with different severity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,或轻或重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that took more time for me to address
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,要花更多时间去处理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and then come back competing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能回来比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,so this time I was healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这次我是健康的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and um I I really wanted to play I kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很想打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.24,EN,,0,0,0,,of missed it and here I am
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点想念它 所以我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.24,0:00:47.20,EN,,0,0,0,,your first time back here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.24,0:00:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是 2023 年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,since 2023 in a career of great matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你第一次回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,where does that final against Alcaraz sit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场决赛你排第几？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,one of the top I say top three finals that I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会说 排前三
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've played best of three uh sets,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我打过的三盘制决赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, in Masters events.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,大师赛这一档
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh just incredible, thrilling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了 又惊险又刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,exciting roller coaster like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,像坐过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,the Park Next Door uh type of ride um
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是隔壁那个游乐园里的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场那样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it went almost four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得打了快四个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh played on the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们在太阳底下打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,we played with the shade,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,又在阴影里打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:23.20,EN,,0,0,0,,we ended up almost in evening hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:23.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后快打到晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh was really anybody's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁赢都有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I had match points and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我拿到过赛点 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, came back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,他又追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and tie break uh really nerve-wracking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,进了抢七 对我们俩来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,for for both of us and we gave it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,都太熬人了 我们拼尽了全力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Um so that was the last time I actually
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是我上一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.36,EN,,0,0,0,,played him in this tournament, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这站比赛跟他交手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,three years ago when I won the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,三年前 我拿了那个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So exciting to to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,能回来真的很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.24,EN,,0,0,0,,We wish you a wonderful week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你这一周顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:45.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:45.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
